      <slug></slug>
      <title>Automated package building</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>BSD Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;With binary package management tools such as pkgin or nih, building sets of packages and maintaining a repository becomes a need, mostly when managing multiple servers. This talk presents the setup of different bulk build solutions in pkgsrc.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
